        "subject": "LU-20219 osd-zfs: fix nested functions in configure",
        "message": "LU-20219 osd-zfs: fix nested functions in configure\n\n... since Clang doesn't support this feature, but gcc does.\nWithout this fix, the LZ_SRC_ZFS_ARC_PRUNE_FUNC_UINT64 check\nwill incorrectly fail.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nChange-Id: Ie807bcafad2a2b6c380b2e31e0cd15ea49b133aa\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65865\nReviewed-by: Brian Behlendorf <behlendorf1@llnl.gov>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nReviewed-by: Shaun Tancheff <shaun.tancheff@hpe.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
